-``kinit``-compatible binary.
+``kinit``-compatible binary. Put any arguments in ``ansible_winrm_kinit_args``
+instead of appending them to the executable path. For example::
+
+    ansible_winrm_kinit_cmd: /opt/CA/uxauth/bin/uxconsole
+    ansible_winrm_kinit_args: -krb -init
+
+When ``ansible_winrm_kinit_args`` is set, its arguments replace the default
+``kinit`` arguments. This includes the ``-f`` flag normally added when
+``ansible_winrm_kerberos_delegation`` is enabled. Include ``-f`` in
+``ansible_winrm_kinit_args`` if the custom command requires it for delegation.
 
